1) Creating a RSA Key
openssl genpkey -algorithm RSA -pkeyopt rsa_keygen_bits:2048 -out bob.key

2) Extracting Public Key
openssl pkey -in bob.key -pubout -out bob.pub

3) Viewing both the keys:
Private: openssl pkey -in bob.key -text -noout
Public: openssl pkey -pubin -in bob.pub -text -noout

4) Encrypt message using Bob public key
openssl pkeyutl -encrypt -pubin -inkey bob.pub -in msg.txt -out msg.enc

5) Decrypt message using Bob private key
openssl pkeyutl -decrypt -inkey bob.key -in msg.enc -out msg.dec

6) To check 
diff msg.enc msg.dec
